Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: describe hims,braillesense-u2-keys
Upstream-Status: Pending

Describe required device resources separately from board wiring, with
explicit supplies and GPIO roles for validation of the runtime device tree.

---
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/hims,braillesense-u2-keys.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,48 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
+%YAML 1.2
+---
+$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/input/hims,braillesense-u2-keys.yaml#
+$schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
+
+title: BrailleSense U2 H432B key matrix, direct controls and selectors
+
+maintainers:
+  - Freya Fractal <24643711+highenergymagic@users.noreply.github.com>
+
+description: |
+  A fixed 3-row 16-column matrix provides 32 routing keys and 15 keyboard
+  controls. Seven separate GPIOs provide media and scroll buttons. Four
+  selector contacts encode two physical three-position switches.
+
+properties:
+  compatible:
+    const: hims,braillesense-u2-keys
+
+  row-gpios:
+    minItems: 3
+    maxItems: 3
+    description: Active-low rows, routing rows first and keyboard row last.
+
+  column-gpios:
+    minItems: 16
+    maxItems: 16
+    description: Active-low matrix column inputs in physical wiring order.
+
+  direct-gpios:
+    minItems: 7
+    maxItems: 7
+    description: Active-low media buttons followed by two direct scroll buttons.
+
+  selector-gpios:
+    minItems: 4
+    maxItems: 4
+    description: Front selector contact pair followed by keypad-lock contacts.
+
+required:
+  - compatible
+  - row-gpios
+  - column-gpios
+  - direct-gpios
+  - selector-gpios
+
+additionalProperties: false
